# Control Module (contract: api/control-openapi.yaml). Its port is published in the normal
# deployment. How to run: http/README.md.

### Status of the service
# Expected: 200, control-module, coordination connected
GET {{control}}/status

### Books per state, queues, last publication and lease check
# Expected: 200
GET {{control}}/control/status

### Seed books: changes data, and downloads them with INGESTION_SOURCE=gutenberg
# Expected: 202 with submitted, added and already_known; repeating it adds nothing
POST {{control}}/control/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_ids": [1342, 84]}

### State of one book
# Expected: 200 with its book-state entry, or 404 if it was never submitted
GET {{control}}/control/tasks/1342

### Task: invalid id
# Expected: 400 INVALID_PARAMETER, field book_id
GET {{control}}/control/tasks/0084

### Task: a book never submitted
# Expected: 404 NOT_FOUND, field book_id
GET {{control}}/control/tasks/999999

### Jobs: one invalid id rejects the whole request
# Expected: 400 INVALID_PARAMETER, field book_ids; nothing is seeded
POST {{control}}/control/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_ids": [84, 0]}

### Jobs: a body that is not JSON
# Expected: 400 INVALID_PARAMETER, field body
POST {{control}}/control/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

not json

### Put the FAILED books back in their queue
# Expected: 200 with requeued
POST {{control}}/control/retry-failed
